WEBVTT

00:07.746 --> 00:08.878
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.965 --> 00:10.706
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.793 --> 00:12.099
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.186 --> 00:14.231
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.318 --> 00:17.495
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.582 --> 00:19.299
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.323 --> 00:21.325
Kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.412 --> 00:23.132
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.197 --> 00:25.329
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.416 --> 00:27.336
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.375 --> 00:29.377
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.464 --> 00:31.311
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.335 --> 00:33.250
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.337 --> 00:35.035
All:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.122 --> 00:37.472
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.559 --> 00:39.300
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.387 --> 00:40.475
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.562 --> 00:42.564
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.651 --> 00:45.262
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.349 --> 00:47.612
[flute plays]
[长笛演奏]

00:47.699 --> 00:48.918
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:50.746 --> 00:53.314
[eerie electronic music]
[诡异的电子音乐]

00:53.401 --> 00:59.755
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:59.842 --> 01:04.716
- Thank you for attending
today's time capsule ceremony.
- 感谢您的出席
今天的时间胶囊仪式。

01:04.803 --> 01:07.415
It's important that future
generations know what
重要的是未来
几代人都知道什么

01:07.502 --> 01:11.897
made Bikini Bottom special,
its citizens and their
使比基尼泳裤变得特别，
它的公民和他们的

01:11.984 --> 01:13.725
random personal belongings.
随机的个人物品。

01:13.812 --> 01:15.945
[cheering]
[欢呼]

01:16.032 --> 01:19.688
And now, please welcome
Miss Sandy Cheeks.
现在，请欢迎
桑迪·奇克斯小姐。

01:19.775 --> 01:21.298
- Thank you, Miss Mayor.
- 谢谢你，市长小姐。

01:21.385 --> 01:24.519
I designed this metallic
vessel to perfectly
我设计了这个金属
容器完美

01:24.606 --> 01:28.740
preserve anything inside for a
very specific amount of time.
保留里面的任何东西
非常具体的时间。

01:28.827 --> 01:30.438
- How much time, Sandy?
- 桑迪，还有多少时间？

01:30.525 --> 01:33.702
- Oh, I don't know,
like, 2,000-ish years.
- 哦，我不知道，
大约2000年左右。

01:33.789 --> 01:36.183
- Let the ceremony begin.
- 仪式开始吧。

01:36.270 --> 01:39.708
[cheering]
[欢呼]

01:39.795 --> 01:42.580
- Mwah!
- 哇！

01:42.667 --> 01:45.583
- I just want to leave a happy
message for the good people
-我只想留下一个快乐
给好人的讯息

01:45.670 --> 01:46.715
of tomorrow.
明天的。

01:46.802 --> 01:48.934
[chortling]
[咯咯笑]

01:50.980 --> 01:56.725
- Ooh, what a fancy trash can.
- 哦，多漂亮的垃圾桶啊。

01:56.812 --> 01:59.510
[loud clarinet music]
[响亮的单簧管音乐]

01:59.597 --> 02:02.122
- Hey, what are you
doing with my clarinet?
- 嘿，你是什么？
我的单簧管在做什么？

02:02.209 --> 02:05.777
- Making it the
future's problem.
- 使其成为
未来的问题。

02:05.864 --> 02:07.779
- Out of my way, Mr. Squidward.
- 让开，章鱼哥先生。

02:07.866 --> 02:11.609
Customers of the future will
pay top dollar for a vintage
未来的客户将
花高价购买葡萄酒

02:11.696 --> 02:14.569
original Krabby Patty.
原来的蟹黄派蒂。

02:14.656 --> 02:16.329
Can I charge for this
now or do I have to wait?
我可以为此收费吗
现在还是我必须等待？

02:16.353 --> 02:19.835
- And that concludes
this momentous occasion.
- 就这样结束了
这个重要的时刻。

02:19.922 --> 02:21.619
Thank you all so much for...
非常感谢大家...

02:21.706 --> 02:23.665
- Not so fast!
- 没那么快！

02:23.752 --> 02:24.752
[crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

02:24.796 --> 02:27.756
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

02:27.843 --> 02:28.583
[crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

02:28.670 --> 02:30.237
- You fools!
- 你们这些傻瓜！

02:30.324 --> 02:32.195
With this patty
in my grasp, I can
有了这个肉饼
在我的掌握中，我可以

02:32.282 --> 02:34.545
finally take over the world!
终于统治世界了！

02:34.632 --> 02:36.678
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

02:36.765 --> 02:38.419
- Yeah, maybe later.
- 是的，也许稍后。

02:38.506 --> 02:40.464
- 2,000 years.
- 2,000 年。

02:40.551 --> 02:41.813
- Huh?
- 啊？

02:41.900 --> 02:44.642
- Much later.
[laughs]
- 很久以后。
[笑]

02:44.729 --> 02:46.775
- Hey, let me out of here!
- 嘿，让我离开这里！

02:46.862 --> 02:48.777
I have to destroy you all.
我必须毁掉你们所有人。

02:48.864 --> 02:50.344
- [chortling]
- [咯咯笑]

02:50.431 --> 02:51.301
- Huh?
- 啊？

02:51.388 --> 02:52.650
No!
不！

02:52.737 --> 02:55.392
Oh, Neptune, no!
哦，海王星，不！

02:55.479 --> 02:56.872
[screams]
[尖叫声]

02:56.959 --> 02:59.788
- As I was saying,
thanks for coming, everybody.
- 正如我所说，
谢谢大家的到来。

02:59.875 --> 03:01.746
Free pizza at city hall!
市政厅免费披萨！

03:01.833 --> 03:03.357
[cheering]
[欢呼]

03:03.444 --> 03:05.750
- Free! Free!
- 自由的！自由的！

03:05.837 --> 03:07.535
- Oh!
Pizza, pizza!
- 哦！
披萨，披萨！

03:07.622 --> 03:09.276
Oh!
哦！

03:09.363 --> 03:10.803
- What have you gotten
yourself into
- 你得到了什么
自己进入

03:10.886 --> 03:12.670
this time, Sheldon?
这次，谢尔顿?

03:12.757 --> 03:16.283
- Karen, get me a can opener
or something, quick.
- 凯伦，给我一个开罐器
或者什么的，快点。

03:16.370 --> 03:19.155
- Well, guess we have to
wait until it opens up.
- 好吧，我想我们必须这样做
等到它打开。

03:19.242 --> 03:20.765
I'll see you later.
稍后见。

03:23.899 --> 03:25.509
[timer ticking]
[计时器滴答作响]

03:25.596 --> 03:27.294
[beep]
[嘟]

03:29.992 --> 03:32.168
- [chortling]
- [咯咯笑]

03:33.387 --> 03:37.217
- At last, after surviving
on this patty one
- 终于，活下来之后
在这个小馅饼上

03:37.304 --> 03:39.784
molecule at a time, I've finally
一次分子，我终于

03:39.871 --> 03:43.092
cracked the secret formula.
破解了秘密配方。

03:43.179 --> 03:45.834
Now my reign of terror can be...
现在我的恐怖统治可以是......

03:45.921 --> 03:47.227
wait a minute.
等一下。

03:47.314 --> 03:50.273
[futuristic beeping]
[未来的嘟嘟声]

03:52.144 --> 03:54.843
This dump looks less dumpy.
这个垃圾场看起来不那么矮胖。

03:54.930 --> 03:57.976
The future must be pretty
great if everything's
未来一定很美好
如果一切都很好就好了

03:58.063 --> 04:01.415
made of chrome, and slidey.
由铬制成，并且很滑。

04:01.502 --> 04:03.808
Hyup.
协。

04:03.895 --> 04:05.680
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

04:05.767 --> 04:07.725
Hey-ee.
嘿嘿。

04:07.812 --> 04:10.815
Mm, pretty. Ooh.
嗯，漂亮。哦。

04:10.902 --> 04:12.077
What?
什么？

04:12.164 --> 04:14.602
The Chrome Bucket?
镀铬桶？

04:14.689 --> 04:16.299
Whoa.
哇哦。

04:18.040 --> 04:19.781
Where's the door?
门在哪里？

04:19.868 --> 04:22.784
I can't take over the world if
I can't even get into my lab.
如果我无法接管世界
我什至不能进入我的实验室。

04:22.871 --> 04:24.873
Karen, let me in!
凯伦，让我进去！

04:24.960 --> 04:27.702
- Sheldon, welcome home.
- 谢尔顿，欢迎回家。

04:27.789 --> 04:30.487
- Karen, is that you?
- 凯伦，是你吗？

04:30.574 --> 04:32.054
I see you've had some work done.
我看到你已经完成了一些工作。

04:32.141 --> 04:33.621
- Uh-huh.
- 呃哈。

04:33.708 --> 04:35.710
And that's not the only
work I've been doing.
这并不是唯一的
我一直在做的工作。

04:35.797 --> 04:37.886
- Ooh.
- 哦。

04:37.973 --> 04:41.063
Have you completed some kind
of deadly destructive robot?
你完成过某种
致命的破坏性机器人？

04:41.150 --> 04:42.717
- Negative.
- 消极的。

04:42.804 --> 04:46.111
I have been working
on my art pieces.
我一直在工作
在我的艺术作品上。

04:46.198 --> 04:48.984
I'm quite successful, in fact.
事实上，我很成功。

04:49.071 --> 04:52.944
- Oh, honey, this would match
the couch in the living room.
- 哦，亲爱的，这很匹配
客厅的沙发。

04:53.031 --> 04:55.512
- We'll take it.
- 我们会接受的。

04:57.079 --> 04:59.299
- Who cares about art?
- 谁关心艺术？

04:59.386 --> 05:01.518
Time to help me
take over the world.
是时候帮助我了
接管世界。

05:01.605 --> 05:05.000
Now, what happened
to the front door?
现在，发生了什么事
到前门？

05:05.087 --> 05:07.394
Ah, never mind.
啊，没关系。

05:07.481 --> 05:09.700
- You don't
understand, Plankton.
- 你不
明白了，浮游生物。

05:09.787 --> 05:12.181
The whole world
is different now.
整个世界
现在不同了。

05:12.268 --> 05:13.400
- Wait, what do you mean?
- 等等，你什么意思？

05:13.487 --> 05:16.272
- Let me show you.
- Whoa!
- 让我告诉你。
- 哇！

05:18.796 --> 05:20.015
- See?
- 看？

05:20.102 --> 05:21.712
This is Squidward's old house.
这是章鱼哥的老房子。

05:21.799 --> 05:24.802
- Huh? Museum of Squidward?
- 啊？章鱼哥博物馆？

05:24.889 --> 05:28.937
Who would ever go to a museum
dedicated to that loser?
谁会去博物馆
献给那个失败者？

05:29.024 --> 05:30.721
- Lots of people.
- 很多人。

05:30.808 --> 05:33.115
Squidward's old clarinet
recordings are considered
章鱼哥的旧单簧管
录音被考虑

05:33.202 --> 05:34.725
classical music now.
现在古典音乐。

05:34.812 --> 05:36.684
- Wow.
- 哇。

05:36.771 --> 05:39.164
They weren't considered
music at all before.
他们没有被考虑
以前根本没有音乐。

05:39.251 --> 05:41.428
- Sadly, no one
started listening
- 可悲的是，没有人
开始听

05:41.515 --> 05:43.908
to them until the day
after he was gone.
直到那一天
他走后。

05:43.995 --> 05:46.171
- Typical.
- 典型的。

05:48.086 --> 05:51.699
- This is what Patrick's
rock looks like now.
- 这就是帕特里克的
摇滚看起来像现在。

05:51.786 --> 05:53.004
- Ugh.
- 呃。

05:53.091 --> 05:54.919
That moron was always an idiot.
那个白痴始终是个白痴。

05:55.006 --> 05:59.359
And his stupid soda cup left
me sticky for 2,000 years.
他那愚蠢的汽水杯离开了
我粘了2000年。

05:59.446 --> 06:01.404
If he were here
right now, I'd sock
如果他在这里
现在，我会穿袜子

06:01.491 --> 06:03.319
him right in his slack jaw.
他就在他松弛的下巴上。

06:03.406 --> 06:04.276
Eh...
呃……

06:04.364 --> 06:08.890
- And this is the P-1000.
- 这是 P-1000。

06:08.977 --> 06:10.718
- I'm hungry.
- 我饿了。

06:10.805 --> 06:12.589
I need a chrome snack.
我需要一份铬合金零食。

06:12.676 --> 06:14.852
- Even as a robot he's an idiot.
- 即使作为机器人他也是个白痴。

06:14.939 --> 06:16.419
- Food!
- 食物！

06:16.506 --> 06:17.942
- Whoa!
- 哇！

06:18.029 --> 06:19.466
- Ew!
- 呃！

06:19.553 --> 06:22.033
This doesn't taste like chrome.
这尝起来不像铬。

06:24.079 --> 06:26.777
I'm going back to bed.
我要回去睡觉了。

06:26.864 --> 06:28.213
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:30.085 --> 06:31.913
Now, let me guess...
现在，让我猜一下...

06:32.000 --> 06:34.306
next, you're going to show me
what happened to SpongeBob.
接下来，你要告诉我
海绵宝宝发生了什么事。

06:34.394 --> 06:37.658
- I wasn't, but if you insist.
- 我不是，但如果你坚持的话。

06:43.011 --> 06:44.795
- Hey, cats.
- 嘿，猫们。

06:44.882 --> 06:46.231
How's it hanging?
挂得怎么样了？

06:46.318 --> 06:48.756
Thanks for stopping by, ya dig?
谢谢你过来，你明白吗？

06:48.843 --> 06:50.714
- Wow, SpongeBob.
- 哇，海绵宝宝。

06:50.801 --> 06:54.326
I can't believe something
here has actually improved,
我无法相信某事
这里确实有所改善，

06:54.414 --> 06:56.198
and that something was you.
那东西就是你。

06:56.285 --> 06:57.329
- It's not SpongeBob.
- 这不是海绵宝宝。

06:57.417 --> 07:02.596
It's his holographic doorman.
这是他的全息门卫。

07:02.683 --> 07:03.510
- [chortling]
- [咯咯笑]

07:03.597 --> 07:05.903
- This is the real SpongeBob,
- 这才是真正的海绵宝宝，

07:05.990 --> 07:07.818
or at least what's left of him.
或者至少是他剩下的东西。

07:07.905 --> 07:09.820
- [chortling]
- [咯咯笑]

07:09.907 --> 07:11.866
- Aww, he likes you.
- 哇，他喜欢你。

07:11.953 --> 07:13.824
- [screams].
- [尖叫]。

07:13.911 --> 07:15.826
Make it stop!
让它停下来！

07:15.913 --> 07:17.915
I was haunted by the echoes
of that laugh
我被回声所困扰
那个笑声

07:18.002 --> 07:21.745
for 2,000 years.
2000 年来。

07:21.832 --> 07:23.791
[screams]
[尖叫声]

07:23.878 --> 07:26.968
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

07:27.055 --> 07:29.623
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

07:29.710 --> 07:31.015
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:31.102 --> 07:33.627
Huh?
啊？

07:33.714 --> 07:39.067
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:39.154 --> 07:40.938
OK, I get it.
好的，我明白了。

07:41.025 --> 07:42.766
The future is awful.
未来很糟糕。

07:42.853 --> 07:45.508
But I know
the secret formula now.
但我知道
现在的秘密配方。

07:45.595 --> 07:48.816
We can take over
this horrible timeline.
我们可以接管
这个可怕的时间线。

07:48.903 --> 07:50.992
- Um, about that.
- 嗯，关于这个。

07:51.079 --> 07:53.951
I think there's something
else you should see.
我认为有一些东西
否则你应该看看。

07:54.038 --> 07:58.434
- The Kromey Krab?
- 克罗米蟹？

07:58.521 --> 08:02.264
"Permanently closed
due to rust."
“永久关闭
由于生锈。”

08:02.351 --> 08:04.048
This is great news.
这是个好消息。

08:04.135 --> 08:06.921
- Ah, not exactly.
- 啊，不完全是。

08:07.008 --> 08:10.011
It doesn't matter if the
Krusty Krab is open or not.
没关系，如果
蟹堡王是否营业。

08:10.098 --> 08:15.973
In the future, everyone
knows the secret formula.
未来大家
知道秘密公式。

08:16.060 --> 08:18.846
- They what?
- 他们什么？

08:18.933 --> 08:22.153
No!
不！

08:22.240 --> 08:23.546
That's it!
就是这样！

08:23.633 --> 08:25.896
I've had it with the future!
我已经受够了未来！

08:25.983 --> 08:28.246
I just want to go back
to all the people I hate.
我只想回去
致所有我讨厌的人。

08:28.333 --> 08:30.814
- Oh, why didn't you say so?
-哦，你为什么不这么说？

08:30.901 --> 08:33.730
I know someone who
might be able to help.
我认识一个人
或许能帮上忙。

08:40.781 --> 08:43.914
- The screwy squirrel?
Really?
- 古怪的松鼠？
真的吗？

08:44.001 --> 08:46.613
- The squirrel didn't
get trapped in a tube
- 松鼠没有
被困在管子里

08:46.700 --> 08:49.006
for 2,000 years, did she?
2000年了，是吗？

08:49.093 --> 08:51.269
- Touché, I guess.
- Touché，我猜。

08:51.356 --> 08:52.749
This is weird.
这很奇怪。

08:52.836 --> 08:55.273
Sandy's place looks
exactly the same.
桑迪的地方看起来
完全一样。

08:55.360 --> 08:57.667
- Indeed, but be warned.
-确实如此，但请注意。

08:57.754 --> 09:01.671
Sandy may not be exactly
how you remember her.
桑迪可能不完全是
你如何记得她。

09:02.933 --> 09:04.631
- Uh...
- 呃...

09:04.718 --> 09:09.244
- Who dares to
knock upon my dome?
- 谁敢
敲我的圆顶吗？

09:09.331 --> 09:13.030
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

09:13.117 --> 09:14.728
- Hello?
- 你好？

09:14.815 --> 09:16.338
Sandy?
沙？

09:16.425 --> 09:18.906
Are you in there?
- [grunts]
你在里面吗？
- [咕哝]

09:18.993 --> 09:20.081
Hi!
你好！

09:20.168 --> 09:21.778
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:21.865 --> 09:24.868
- Sandy Cheeks at your
service, Mr. Plankton.
- 桑迪脸颊在你的
服务，浮游生物先生。

09:24.955 --> 09:27.697
- What the...
how did you get younger?
- 什么...
你是怎么变年轻的？

09:27.784 --> 09:30.439
- Oh, I've just been
jumping through the ages
- 哦，我刚刚
跨越岁月的跳跃

09:30.526 --> 09:32.615
since summer ended
at Kamp Koral.
自从夏天结束以来
在坎普科拉尔。

09:32.702 --> 09:35.749
- Oh, just exploring
space and time, huh?
-哦，只是探索
空间和时间吧？

09:35.836 --> 09:38.447
How wonderful.
多么美妙啊。

09:38.534 --> 09:41.189
Please take me back to
the present, please!
请带我回到
现在，请！

09:41.276 --> 09:42.843
I hate the future.
我讨厌未来。

09:42.930 --> 09:44.061
I hate it!
我恨它！

09:44.148 --> 09:45.454
- [giggles].
- [咯咯笑]。

09:45.541 --> 09:47.195
No need to beg, Mr. Plankton.
没必要乞求，浮游生物先生。

09:47.282 --> 09:49.240
I've been expecting you.
我一直在等你。

09:49.327 --> 09:52.113
The time hopper's all gassed up.
时间跳跃者已经充满了气。

09:52.200 --> 09:53.505
- Well, where is it?
- 那么，它在哪里？

09:53.593 --> 09:55.682
- You're standing
in it, partner.
- 你站着
在其中，伙伴。

09:55.769 --> 09:59.163
This here tree dome is
my reverse time capsule.
这里的树圆顶是
我的逆时空胶囊。

09:59.250 --> 10:01.209
- Then what are we waiting for?
-那我们还等什么？

10:01.296 --> 10:03.820
Away we go!
我们走吧！

10:03.907 --> 10:06.867
[both vocalizing]
[两人都发声]

10:06.954 --> 10:08.172
- So long, Karen!
- 再见，凯伦！

10:08.259 --> 10:10.827
See you 2,000 years ago.
2000年前再见。

10:14.831 --> 10:19.357
- You can come out now,
Plankton 2.0.
- 你现在可以出来了
浮游生物2.0。

10:21.185 --> 10:23.405
- I thought he'd never leave.
- 我以为他永远不会离开。

10:23.492 --> 10:26.147
Now lay some chrome on me, baby.
现在给我涂点铬吧，宝贝。

10:26.234 --> 10:27.104
- [purrs]
- [呼噜声]

10:27.191 --> 10:28.802
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

10:30.020 --> 10:31.239
[loud bang]
[巨响]

10:31.326 --> 10:33.067
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

10:33.154 --> 10:35.852
Mwah, mwah, mwah!
哇，哇，哇！

10:35.939 --> 10:37.593
I never thought
I'd say this, but I
我从没想过
我想说这个，但我

10:37.680 --> 10:39.769
missed this horrible place.
错过了这个可怕的地方。

10:39.856 --> 10:42.859
Oh, and thank you
for your help or whatever.
哦，谢谢你
为了你的帮助或者其他什么。

10:42.946 --> 10:44.644
Be gone now.
现在就走吧。

10:44.731 --> 10:46.210
- Ain't you
forgetting something?
- 不是你吗
忘记了什么？

10:46.297 --> 10:48.038
- All right, all right.
- 好吧，好吧。

10:48.125 --> 10:49.257
Can you break a single?
能破单吗？

10:49.344 --> 10:50.824
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

10:50.911 --> 10:52.521
I don't need a tip,
but I will need you
我不需要小费
但我需要你

10:52.608 --> 10:54.784
to forget that secret formula.
忘记那个秘密公式。

10:54.871 --> 10:57.700
Hold still while I activate
my memory-erasing device.
当我激活时请保持不动
我的记忆擦除设备。

10:57.787 --> 11:00.703
- Your what?
- 你的什么？

11:00.790 --> 11:03.097
- See you back at camp,
Mr. Plankton.
- 营地见
浮游生物先生。

11:03.184 --> 11:06.927
[soft music]
[轻音乐]

11:07.014 --> 11:09.059
- Oh.
- 哦。

11:09.146 --> 11:11.279
What happened?
发生了什么？

11:11.366 --> 11:13.629
How did I get here?
我是怎么到这里的？

11:13.716 --> 11:15.022
[groans]
[呻吟]

11:15.109 --> 11:16.806
Huh?
啊？

11:16.893 --> 11:18.025
Aha!
啊哈！

11:18.112 --> 11:20.854
- Customers of the future
will pay top dollar
- 未来的客户
将支付高额费用

11:20.941 --> 11:23.291
for a vintage
original Krabby Patty.
适合年份
原来的蟹黄派蒂。

11:23.378 --> 11:25.728
- A Krabby Patty!
Ho-ho-ho!
- 蟹肉饼！
嗬嗬嗬！

11:25.815 --> 11:28.165
Now's my chance.
现在我的机会来了。

11:28.252 --> 11:31.125
Not so fast!
没那么快！

11:31.212 --> 11:32.343
[crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

11:32.430 --> 11:34.041
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

11:34.128 --> 11:35.042
You fools!
你们这些傻瓜！

11:35.129 --> 11:36.521
Huh?
啊？

11:36.608 --> 11:38.654
Is anyone else having déjà vu?
还有人有似曾相识的感觉吗？

11:38.741 --> 11:42.049
- See you in 2,000-ish
years, Plankton.
- 2000 年后见
年，浮游生物。

11:42.136 --> 11:43.180
[laughs]
[笑]

11:43.267 --> 11:45.922
- 2,000 years.
- 2,000 年。

11:46.009 --> 11:47.141
- Huh?
- 啊？

11:47.228 --> 11:48.708
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

11:50.274 --> 11:53.147
[upbeat country music]
[欢快的乡村音乐]

11:53.234 --> 11:59.849
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:01.242 --> 12:03.853
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

12:07.161 --> 12:09.946
Oh, Gary!
哦，加里！

12:10.033 --> 12:12.122
Breakfast is served.
供应早餐。

12:12.209 --> 12:14.255
- [braying]
- [嘶叫]

12:14.342 --> 12:15.865
- Gary?
- 加里？

12:15.952 --> 12:17.625
Ooh, you sure sound
different this morning.
哦，你确实听起来
今天早上不同。

12:17.649 --> 12:19.303
- [braying]
- Ah!
- [嘶叫]
- 啊！

12:21.305 --> 12:24.656
- [braying]
- [嘶叫]

12:24.744 --> 12:28.486
Oh, it's Narlene's sea mule.
哦，这是纳琳的海骡。

12:29.574 --> 12:31.315
Hey there, buddy.
嘿，伙计。

12:31.402 --> 12:33.230
Did you come to see me?
你来看我了吗？

12:33.317 --> 12:35.319
- [braying]
- [嘶叫]

12:36.843 --> 12:37.844
- Huh.
- 嗯。

12:37.931 --> 12:38.931
"Play me."
“玩我吧。”

12:43.458 --> 12:46.200
- [speaking Nobbese]
Patrick, Sandy, you...
- [讲诺布语]
帕特里克、桑迪，你们……

12:46.287 --> 12:49.072
[speaking Nobbese]
[诺布语]

12:49.159 --> 12:50.552
- Meow?
- 喵？

12:50.639 --> 12:52.597
- Oh, I speak Nobbese.
- 哦，我说诺布语。

12:52.684 --> 12:54.164
I'll translate for you.
我来给你翻译。

12:54.251 --> 12:55.775
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

12:55.862 --> 12:59.213
Narlene and Nobby invite you,
Patrick, Sandy, and definitely
纳琳和诺比邀请你，
帕特里克、桑迪，当然还有

12:59.300 --> 13:02.085
not Squidward to our
family's Annual Bumble Jelly
不是我们的章鱼哥
家庭年度大黄蜂果冻

13:02.172 --> 13:04.348
Harvest in Bikini Holler.
穿着比基尼的收获。

13:04.435 --> 13:07.177
This recording will
self-destruct in three,
这段录音将
三段自毁，

13:07.264 --> 13:10.528
two, one, ze...
二、一、泽...

13:10.615 --> 13:12.356
Be a good boy, Gary!
做一个好孩子，加里！

13:12.443 --> 13:14.054
I'll be back later!
我稍后回来！

13:14.141 --> 13:16.012
- Meow.
- 喵。

13:16.099 --> 13:17.927
Meow.
喵。

13:22.105 --> 13:24.455
[rock music playing]
[摇滚乐演奏]

13:24.542 --> 13:26.806
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

13:26.893 --> 13:30.157
[upbeat country music]
[欢快的乡村音乐]

13:30.244 --> 13:34.030
- ♪ Oh, we're on our
way to Bikini Holler ♪
- ♪ 哦，我们正在我们的
去比基尼大喊的路♪

13:34.117 --> 13:36.032
- [yodels]
- [约德尔调]

13:36.119 --> 13:38.556
-♪ The road behind us
is getting smaller ♪
-♪ 我们身后的路
越来越小了♪

13:38.643 --> 13:40.558
- [yodels]
- ♪ The grass is green ♪
- [约德尔调]
- ♪ 草是绿的 ♪

13:40.645 --> 13:42.256
♪ And the trees are taller ♪
♪ 树更高了 ♪

13:42.343 --> 13:43.779
- [yodels]
- [约德尔调]

13:43.866 --> 13:47.739
♪ And I'll stop yodeling
for just a dollar ♪
♪ 我会停止唱约德尔歌
只要一美元♪

13:49.916 --> 13:51.526
- Whoa!
- 哇！

13:51.613 --> 13:53.484
- Why in tarnation
are we stopping?
- 为何陷入困境
我们停下来吗？

13:53.571 --> 13:55.095
Come on, mule.
来吧，骡子。

13:55.182 --> 13:56.923
Get moving.
行动起来吧。

13:58.359 --> 14:01.449
- Look out below!
- 看下面！

14:01.536 --> 14:03.233
- Narlene!
- 纳琳！

14:03.320 --> 14:04.539
Nobby!
诺比！

14:04.626 --> 14:05.845
- In the flesh.
- 在肉体中。

14:05.932 --> 14:08.630
- [speaking Nobbese] flesh.
- [诺布语] 肉体。

14:08.717 --> 14:10.284
- Howdy, Narlene and Nobby.
- 你好，纳琳和诺比。

14:10.371 --> 14:13.200
Seems your mule just
plum stopped moving.
看来你的骡子只是
梅停止了动作。

14:13.287 --> 14:16.638
- Why don't I open her up
and check the engine?
- 为什么我不打开她的心扉
并检查发动机？

14:16.725 --> 14:20.207
- Why do you even
have a head, huh?
- 你为什么还要
有头吧？

14:20.294 --> 14:24.428
- Uh, it keeps the rain
out of my neck hole.
- 呃，它一直在下雨
从我的颈洞里出来。

14:26.169 --> 14:27.431
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

14:27.518 --> 14:30.695
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:30.782 --> 14:32.610
- [speaking Nobbese] Get in!
- [诺布语] 进来！

14:32.697 --> 14:34.221
- What gives?
- 给什么？

14:34.308 --> 14:37.267
- The mule refuses to walk
through these parts
- 骡子拒绝行走
通过这些部分

14:37.354 --> 14:40.618
'cause this here road
goes right through...
因为这里的路
直接穿过...

14:40.705 --> 14:43.491
- Plankton Territory?
- 浮游生物领地？

14:43.578 --> 14:46.320
- That's right, Planktons.
- 没错，浮游生物。

14:46.407 --> 14:48.322
[spits]
[吐口水]

14:48.409 --> 14:51.064
- "Narwhals keep out"?
- “独角鲸远离”？

14:51.151 --> 14:52.543
Ah!
啊!

14:53.675 --> 14:55.807
- Go home, Narwhals!
- 回家吧，独角鲸！

14:55.895 --> 14:58.549
- This here is Plankton land!
- 这里是浮游生物之地！

14:58.636 --> 15:03.903
- We don't want your fancy
ivory tusks around here!
- 我们不想要你的幻想
这里有象牙！

15:03.990 --> 15:06.557
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

15:06.644 --> 15:08.951
Let's skedaddle!
我们来溜溜吧！

15:10.561 --> 15:12.128
- Why are they doing this?
- 他们为什么要这样做？

15:12.215 --> 15:14.087
- Planktons and
the Narwhals have
- 浮游生物和
独角鲸有

15:14.174 --> 15:16.611
been feuding for generations.
世世代代都有争斗。

15:16.698 --> 15:19.831
They claim the bumble
jelly fields are theirs
他们声称是笨蛋
果冻田是他们的

15:19.919 --> 15:23.009
while we know they're ours.
虽然我们知道它们是我们的。

15:23.096 --> 15:26.186
- Why don't you
share the fields?
- 你为什么不呢
共享字段？

15:26.273 --> 15:28.188
- Well, where's the fun in that?
- 那么，这有什么乐趣呢？

15:28.275 --> 15:31.191
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

15:31.278 --> 15:36.065
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:36.152 --> 15:37.719
Oh.
哦。

15:37.806 --> 15:41.201
Here we be, bumble jelly fields.
我们在这里，大黄蜂果冻田。

15:41.288 --> 15:42.680
[bumble jellies buzzing]
[大黄蜂果冻嗡嗡作响]

15:42.767 --> 15:45.422
- Whoa.
[laughter]
- 哇哦。
[笑声]

15:45.509 --> 15:48.599
- My brothers there peck the
trees where the bumble jellies
- 我的兄弟们在那里啄食
熊果冻所在的树

15:48.686 --> 15:50.993
store their jelly.
储存他们的果冻。

15:51.080 --> 15:52.821
My sisters over there
like to squeeze it
我的姐妹们在那边
喜欢挤它

15:52.908 --> 15:55.084
fresh right out of the hive.
刚从蜂巢里出来的。

15:55.171 --> 15:57.957
The old folks prefer to serenade
老人们更喜欢听小夜曲

15:58.044 --> 16:01.264
the jelly out of the bumbles.
果冻从大黄蜂中出来。

16:01.351 --> 16:05.051
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

16:05.138 --> 16:08.532
- SpongeBob, Sandy,
meet our ma and pa.
- 海绵宝宝、桑迪、
认识一下我们的妈妈和爸爸。

16:08.619 --> 16:10.404
- Howdy.
- 你好。

16:10.491 --> 16:14.712
- Say, man, is that pink
city slicker with you?
- 说吧，伙计，那是粉红色的吗
城市里有你吗？

16:14.799 --> 16:21.415
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:21.502 --> 16:23.547
He sure is brave.
他确实很勇敢。

16:23.634 --> 16:25.375
- Brave?
- Yup.
- 勇敢的？
- 是的。

16:25.462 --> 16:27.464
The only reason
the bumble jellies
唯一的原因
熊果冻

16:27.551 --> 16:29.814
let us collect their
jelly is because we
让我们收集他们的
果冻是因为我们

16:29.901 --> 16:31.338
allow 'em to sting us.
让他们蜇我们吧。

16:31.425 --> 16:32.643
[laughs]
[笑]

16:32.730 --> 16:34.645
- You let them sting you?
- 你让他们蜇你吗？

16:34.732 --> 16:37.257
- Darn tootin'!
- 该死的！

16:38.301 --> 16:39.520
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

16:39.607 --> 16:40.434
- Whoo-hoo!
- 呼呼！

16:40.521 --> 16:42.479
I consent.
我同意。

16:42.566 --> 16:45.265
- It's worth it.
- 这是值得的。

16:45.352 --> 16:47.354
- Help!
- 帮助！

16:47.441 --> 16:49.182
- There, there, son.
- 那里，那里，儿子。

16:49.269 --> 16:51.662
You gotta hold still
to complete the, uh,
你必须保持不动
完成，呃，

16:51.749 --> 16:55.014
social contract.
社会契约。

16:55.101 --> 16:58.191
Well, now that wasn't
so bad now, was it?
好吧，现在那不是
现在太糟糕了，是吗？

16:58.278 --> 17:00.628
- No, sir.
- 不，先生。

17:00.715 --> 17:03.326
[screams]
[尖叫声]

17:03.413 --> 17:06.590
[laughter]
[笑声]

17:08.331 --> 17:12.814
- Bumble jelly,
bumble jelly, bumble jelly.
- 大黄蜂果冻，
大黄蜂果冻，大黄蜂果冻。

17:12.901 --> 17:16.687
- I declare that this here
is a bountiful bumper crop
- 我在此声明
是五谷丰登

17:16.774 --> 17:20.517
of beautiful bumble jelly.
美丽的大黄蜂果冻。

17:20.604 --> 17:22.084
[horn blows]
[号角吹响]

17:22.171 --> 17:23.868
[cheering]
[欢呼]

17:23.955 --> 17:26.088
- Harvest time is over.
- 收获季节结束了。

17:26.175 --> 17:32.703
Let the bumble jelly
festival commence!
让大黄蜂果冻
节日开始！

17:32.790 --> 17:35.576
- [speaking Nobbese] Festival!
- [诺布语] 节日！

17:35.663 --> 17:39.536
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:39.623 --> 17:41.277
[bell rings]
[铃声响起]

17:41.364 --> 17:42.409
[trumpet plays]
[喇叭演奏]

17:42.496 --> 17:49.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:53.724 --> 17:56.597
[banjo playing]
[班卓琴演奏]

17:59.904 --> 18:06.215
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:06.302 --> 18:08.435
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

18:08.522 --> 18:11.655
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:11.742 --> 18:13.701
[laughter]
[笑声]

18:13.788 --> 18:16.617
- Jelly flop!
- 果冻失败！

18:16.704 --> 18:17.487
- Mm-hmm.
- 嗯嗯。

18:17.574 --> 18:18.793
Good contour.
轮廓好。

18:18.880 --> 18:19.663
Strong structure.
结构坚固。

18:19.750 --> 18:23.189
A very bold mold.
非常大胆的模具。

18:23.276 --> 18:24.949
Hey, why is your cousin
in the long trench coat
嘿，为什么是你表弟
穿着长风衣

18:24.973 --> 18:26.627
tipping over that jelly barrel?
打翻果冻桶？

18:26.714 --> 18:29.325
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

18:30.544 --> 18:31.936
- Wait a sec.
- 等一下。

18:32.023 --> 18:34.113
That ain't no cousin.
那不是表弟。

18:35.592 --> 18:37.551
[all cackling]
[全都咯咯笑]

18:37.638 --> 18:39.335
It's Planktons!
这是浮游生物！

18:39.422 --> 18:40.554
- Planktons!
- 浮游生物！

18:40.641 --> 18:42.686
- Let 'em have it!
- 让他们拥有吧！

18:42.773 --> 18:45.385
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

18:45.472 --> 18:52.609
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:52.957 --> 18:56.004
- We've got ourselves a feud!
- 我们之间有仇！

18:56.091 --> 18:57.484
Oh!
哦！

18:57.571 --> 18:58.746
Lordy Neptune!
海王星阁下！

18:58.833 --> 19:02.010
I've been spud smacked!
我被马铃薯打了！

19:03.446 --> 19:06.406
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

19:06.493 --> 19:11.846
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:11.933 --> 19:14.849
- Fire in the hole.
- 洞里着火。

19:14.936 --> 19:18.069
[triumphant organ music]
[胜利的管风琴音乐]

19:22.248 --> 19:23.771
- Yeehaw!
- 耶哈！

19:23.858 --> 19:26.426
Whoo-hoo-hoo!
呼呼呼！

19:26.513 --> 19:28.993
Yeah!
是的！

19:30.778 --> 19:34.129
- [laughing]
- [笑]

19:34.216 --> 19:36.044
- What do we do know?
- 我们知道什么？

19:36.131 --> 19:38.655
- Them Planktons can
throw all the potatoes
- 浮游生物可以
把所有的土豆都扔掉

19:38.742 --> 19:40.179
in the ocean at us.
在我们的海洋里。

19:40.266 --> 19:42.050
We've got us something
special that'll
我们有一些东西
特别的那会

19:42.137 --> 19:44.966
give us a decisive victory.
给我们带来决定性的胜利。

19:45.053 --> 19:47.925
- [speaking Nobbese]
Secret weapon.
- [讲诺布语]
秘密武器。

19:50.928 --> 19:53.453
- We need more taters.
- 我们需要更多土豆泥。

19:56.717 --> 19:58.762
- Oh, no!
- 哦，不！

20:01.156 --> 20:03.550
Everyone take cover!
大家都躲起来！

20:03.637 --> 20:07.815
It's shoes!
是鞋子！

20:07.902 --> 20:10.731
[planktons screaming]
[浮游生物尖叫]

20:13.647 --> 20:16.780
- Well, this stinks.
- 嗯，这很臭。

20:16.867 --> 20:20.393
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

20:20.480 --> 20:22.743
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

20:22.830 --> 20:29.358
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

20:33.623 --> 20:35.451
- [yells]
- [大喊]

20:37.758 --> 20:39.803
- Oh, no.
- 哦，不。

20:39.890 --> 20:41.022
I'm out of shoes.
我没鞋了

20:41.109 --> 20:43.807
We plum tossed 'em all.
我们把它们都扔掉了。

20:43.894 --> 20:46.114
[rhythmic footsteps]
[有节奏的脚步声]

20:46.201 --> 20:48.029
- What's that sound?
- 那是什么声音？

20:48.116 --> 20:50.074
- I don't rightly know.
- 我不太清楚。

20:50.161 --> 20:53.513
Sounds like shoes.
听起来像鞋子。

20:53.600 --> 21:00.520
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:00.607 --> 21:03.087
- We'd like a truce.
- 我们想要休战。

21:03.174 --> 21:04.872
Ain't no reason
Narwhals and Plankton
不是没有理由
独角鲸和浮游生物

21:04.959 --> 21:07.266
can't share the fields.
无法共享字段。

21:07.353 --> 21:09.964
Besides, we ran
out of ammo thanks
除此之外，我们还跑了
没有弹药了，谢谢

21:10.051 --> 21:12.488
to your tater-eating
city slicker.
给你吃土豆的
城市更光滑。

21:14.534 --> 21:16.100
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

21:16.187 --> 21:17.972
- Nice work, Patrick.
- 干得好，帕特里克。

21:18.059 --> 21:22.193
- It was an honor to serve.
- 能够服务是我的荣幸。

21:23.543 --> 21:25.196
- A truce, eh?
- 休战，嗯？

21:25.284 --> 21:28.069
Well, seeing as how
we're all out of shoes.
嗯，看看如何
我们都没有鞋子了。

21:28.156 --> 21:29.636
- You want 'em back?
- 你想让他们回来吗？

21:29.723 --> 21:30.898
- Oh, heck.
- 哦，哎呀。

21:30.985 --> 21:32.421
You can keep 'em.
你可以保留它们。

21:32.508 --> 21:35.990
Besides, we ain't
found much use for 'em.
此外，我们不是
发现它们有很多用处。

21:38.732 --> 21:40.255
- What happens now?
- 现在会发生什么？

21:40.342 --> 21:42.823
- The annual post-feud party.
- 一年一度的争吵后聚会。

21:42.910 --> 21:44.259
- Annual?
- 年度的？

21:44.346 --> 21:46.305
You mean you do this every year?
你的意思是你每年都这样做？

21:46.392 --> 21:47.610
- Sure do.
- 当然可以。

21:47.697 --> 21:48.785
It's fun.
很有趣。

21:48.872 --> 21:50.570
Why, didn't y'all have fun?
怎么，大家都没玩得开心吗？

21:50.657 --> 21:53.486
- We did not have fun.
- 我们没有玩得很开心。

21:53.573 --> 21:55.139
We had...
我们有...

21:55.226 --> 21:58.795
both: The best day ever!
两人：有史以来最好的一天！

21:58.882 --> 22:01.494
[cheering]
[欢呼]

22:04.105 --> 22:07.064
[upbeat country music]
[欢快的乡村音乐]

22:07.151 --> 22:09.371
- Whoo-hoo!
- 呼呼！

